      "message": "Question on the GN build config:\n\n1. After moving things dawn::native::devtool to dawn::devtool,\nalthough specifying `dawn_component(\"devtool_playback\")`, seems I\u0027m losing the build target `libdevtool_playback.so`, unless I add it as a dep to `dawn/native/BUILD.gn`.\n\nDo you know what I\u0027m missing to config `dawn/devtool:devtool_playback` like a seperate build target as say `dawn/native:native`?\n\n2. To make dawn::native uses `devtool_record` and `devtool_playback`, do I need to put devtool headers into `include/dawn/devtool/`, and config them like `include/dawn/native/DawnNative.h` as public headers?",
