      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) GN starts from the root GN files and discover files as targets are specified. You can add devtools to a new group there that\u0027s referenced by `all`.\n\n2) Splitting headers to `include/dawn/devtools` is not necessary for \"internal libraries\". For example `dawn/common` or `dawn/utils` don\u0027t do that.",
